,"f":["M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":130,"l":157},{"e":"١١٠","v":"18:110"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"18:98","t":"[Dhul-Qarnayn] said, \"This is a mercy from my Lord; but when the promise of my Lord comes [i.e., approaches], He will make it level, and ever is the promise of my Lord true.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":98,"sd":null},{"k":"18:99","t":"And We will leave them that day surging over each other, and [then] the Horn will be blown, and We will assemble them in [one] assembly.","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":99,"sd":null},{"k":"18:100","t":"And We will present Hell that Day to the disbelievers, on display -","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":100,"sd":null},{"k":"18:101","t":"Those whose eyes had been within a cover [removed] from My remembrance, and they were not able to hear.","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":101,"sd":null},{"k":"18:102","t":"Then do those who disbelieve think that they can take My servants instead of Me as allies? Indeed, We have prepared Hell for the disbelievers as a lodging.","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":102,"sd":null},{"k":"18:103","t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Shall we [believers] inform you of the greatest losers as to [their] deeds?","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":103,"sd":null},{"k":"18:104","t":"[They are] those whose effort is lost in worldly life, while they think that they are doing well in work.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":104,"sd":null},{"k":"18:105","t":"Those are the ones who disbelieve in the verses of their Lord and in [their] meeting Him, so their deeds have become worthless; and We will not assign to them on the Day of Resurrection any weight [i.e., importance].","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":105,"sd":null},{"k":"18:106","t":"That is their recompense - Hell - for what they denied and [because] they took My signs and My messengers in ridicule.","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":106,"sd":null},{"k":"18:107","t":"Indeed, those who have believed and done righteous deeds - they will have the Gardens of Paradise as a lodging,","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":107,"sd":null},{"k":"18:108","t":"Wherein they abide eternally. They will not desire from it any transfer.","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":108,"sd":null},{"k":"18:109","t":"Say, \"If the sea were ink for [writing] the words of my Lord, the sea would be exhausted before the words of my Lord were exhausted, even if We brought the like of it in [continual] supplement.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":109,"sd":null},{"k":"18:110","t":"Say, \"I am only a man like you, to whom has been revealed that your god is one God. So whoever would hope for the meeting with his Lord - let him do righteous work and not associate in the worship of his Lord anyone.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":18,"a":110,"sd":null}],"juz":16,"hizb":31,"surahs":[18],"sajdah":false}